timestamp=2026-11-04T15:45:06.914Z level=INFO run=258c00cc message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nimport csv\n\nwith open('/app/dataset/hospital_compensation_registry.csv') as f:\n    rows = list(csv.DictReader(f))\n\n# check PAT_006's case: life event claim by PAT_006. PAT_006 has EC PAT_078. PAT_078 has claims. Anyone related with no claims?\n# PAT_006 has claim (life event claim) - so they are not a \"patient that didn't file any claims yet\" as stated in problem.\n# So they don't count as no-claim patients. Correct.\npatient_has_claim = {}\nfor r in rows:\n    pid = r['patient_id']\n    if r['record_date'].strip():\n        patient_has_claim[pid] = True\nfor r in rows:\n    pid = r['patient_id']\n    if pid not in patient_has_claim:\n        patient_has_claim[pid] = False\n\nprint('PAT_006 has_claim:', patient_has_claim.get('PAT_006'))\nprint('PAT_023 has_claim:', patient_has_claim.get('PAT_023'))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
